{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261025/photo/bkn-20261025135000702-1025_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261025145302\"/><p>屯門發生山火。今午(25日)1時38分，執法部門接獲多名市民報案指，分別指屯門良景邨及山景邨對開山頭發生山火，冒出大量濃煙，火乘風勢，山火愈燒愈烈。消防正前往撲救，同時通知政府飛行服務隊直升機投擲水彈協助救火。</p><p>香港天文台今晨6時，發出黃色火災危險警告，表示火災危險性頗高。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.272452+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:47.466254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:47.466254+00:00","content_hash":"70bbff42680431d987bc96d01ebccfb5a583808a3692d6ddbb61a7b703ca037e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}